<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Harborline.Api.Foundation.UpdateFeed</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Harborline.Api.Foundation.UpdateFeed</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Harborline.Api.Foundation.UpdateFeed</RootNamespace>
    <Description>Update-feed contract (design note update-feed-design-2026-07-07 #155, slice U1). The static, signed CDN file-tree that sits between "a pack is signed" and "a node installs it": the channel index (channel.json), the per-pack version index (packs/&lt;key&gt;/index.json), the signed revocation list (revocations.json), and the content-addressed manifest + artifact blobs. Reuses Harborline.Api.Foundation.Crypto (CanonicalJson / Ed25519 / SignedOperation) + Harborline.Api.Foundation.Blobs (Cid) + Harborline.Api.Foundation.Packs (PackManifest / PackFile / PackRevocationManifest / trust store) — no second canonicalizer, no new crypto. Carries the F1 signed validUntil freshness fence, the F2 monotonic-sequence anti-rollback fence, the F3 revocationsCid coupling (fail-closed), and the reserved F4 rootAttestationUrl rotation seam. The generator (Harborline.Tooling.UpdateFeed, U1) produces it; the node feed client (U2) and marketplace Browse (#136) consume it; a mirror is a dumb byte-for-byte copy (signatures verify vs the pinned root, never the serving URL).</Description>
    <PackageTags>update-feed;channel;cdn;ed25519;canonical-json;cid;merkle;revocation;tuf;trust-store;harborline;foundation;adr-0147</PackageTags>
    <!-- CS1591 suppressed at package level (matches sibling foundation-* packages): the public
         surface is documented, but small DTO members need not each carry a doc comment to keep the
         0/0 build under the repo-wide GenerateDocumentationFile + TreatWarningsAsErrors. -->
    <NoWarn>CS1591</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="tests/**/*.cs" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Harborline.Api.Foundation.UpdateFeed.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- CanonicalJson (S-14 single canonicalizer), Ed25519Signer/Verifier + SignedOperation +
         PrincipalId + Signature (the channel-root signing envelope), Cid (content addressing). -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\foundation\Harborline.Foundation.csproj" />
    <!-- PackManifest / PackFile / PackFileCodec / PackSignatureSubject (the publisher-signed artifact
         this feed references by CID), PackRevocationManifest + PackRevocationListVerifier (the
         revocation list the feed HOSTS, S-11), PackVerifier + the scope-carrying trust store (S-13),
         PackVersion (the S-8 monotonic-version comparator). Reused wholesale — the feed only
         distributes what the pack composer already signs. -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\foundation-packs\Harborline.Foundation.Packs.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
